  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Refusing gracefully uses softening structures: 'I'm afraid that won't be possible at this time', 'That's not something we're able to accommodate', 'I'd rather not commit to that just yet'. These decline clearly while preserving the relationship.",
    "explanation_ko": "우아하게 거절할 때는 완화하는 구조를 씁니다: 'I'm afraid that won't be possible at this time', 'That's not something we're able to accommodate', 'I'd rather not commit to that just yet'. 관계를 지키면서도 명확하게 거절합니다.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "I'm afraid that won't be possible at this time.",
        "ko": "죄송하지만 지금은 그게 어려울 것 같아요."
      },
      {
        "en": "That's not something we're able to accommodate.",
        "ko": "그건 저희가 수용할 수 없는 부분이에요."
      },
      {
        "en": "I'd rather not commit to that just yet.",
        "ko": "아직은 그것에 대해 확답을 드리고 싶지 않아요."
      }
    ]
  },
